<Placemark>   <name>Ahlder Kreuzsteine</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Cross <b>County/Region:</b> Lower Saxony, Bremen <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>4</b> Condition: <b>4</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 52.37316 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 7.29558<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Germany/LowerSaxonyBremen/thumb/fbjj_DSC07801.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    Ancient Cross in Lower Saxony, Bremen. Looks like three conciliation crosses or Sühnekreuze. The site goes with an old story about three robbers who killed eachother. I visited the place in 2020....<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
		     <a href="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=61012" >Link To More Information</a><br />
                    ]]></description>    <styleUrl>#46_r</styleUrl>   <Point>     <coordinates>7.29558,52.37316,0</coordinates>   </Point>  </Placemark>
