<Placemark>   <name>'Point of view' Monolith</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Modern Stone Circle etc <b>County/Region:</b> Lower Saxony, Bremen <b>Alt Name:</b> Menhir auf der Felsrippe <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>3</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 52.317993 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 8.018822<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Germany/LowerSaxonyBremen/thumb/rsOSPbrg_14a.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
